    "type": "question",
    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "The ratio of the number of girls to the number of boys in a class is $3:4$. If there are 20 boys, how many girls are there?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "15 girls.",
      "worked": "The boys represent 4 parts.\n$$\\begin{align*}1\\text{ part}&=20\\div4=5\\text{ students}\\\\\\text{Number of girls}&=3\\times5=15\\end{align*}$$\nThere are 15 girls.",
